1
00:00:07,298 --> 00:00:09,008
- Howard wolowitz.
- Hey.

2
00:00:09,217 --> 00:00:12,637
(Voice:)Dave Roeger, here, at NASA. We need
to talk about your upcoming mission.

3
00:00:12,846 --> 00:00:16,686
(Howard:)Yes, yes, I've been doing
my push-ups.

4
00:00:17,475 --> 00:00:20,855
(Howard:)I'm still stuck at nine, but...

5
00:00:22,313 --> 00:00:25,813
(Howard:)That's going all the way down
with no one holding me, heh.

6
00:00:26,234 --> 00:00:28,864
(Roeger:)That's great, uh, but that's not why I called.

7
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:30,530
(Roeger:)We've run into a bit of a snafu.

8
00:00:30,739 --> 00:00:33,199
(Roeger:)Your Soyuz capsule failed
the pressurization test...

9
00:00:33,408 --> 00:00:36,908
(Roeger:)...so bottom line,
the mission's been scrubbed.

10
00:00:38,413 --> 00:00:41,413
(Howard(Picks up receiver):)You're kidding.
So, what does that mean?

11
00:00:42,417 --> 00:00:44,047
(Howard(Picks up receiver):)Uh-huh.

12
00:00:44,711 --> 00:00:46,671
Uh-huh, heh.

13
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:49,840
Boy, I gotta tell you,
I'm really disappointed.

14
00:00:50,050 --> 00:00:54,180
(Howard(Picks up receiver):)This was my dream
ever since I was a little kid.

15
00:00:54,846 --> 00:00:57,886
Okay, uh... Thanks for the call.

16
00:00:58,099 --> 00:01:00,809
Yeah, you too.

17
00:01:01,019 --> 00:01:03,269
(Howard(Picks up receiver):)Yes! Thank you!

18
00:01:06,274 --> 00:01:09,364
Oh, I'm not gonna die in space!

19
00:01:10,612 --> 00:01:12,742
Phew, I'm gonna die the way God intended.

20
00:01:12,947 --> 00:01:18,037
(Howard(Picks up receiver):)In my late 50s
with a heart full of pastrami.

